                  <p><b><i>Chair</i></b> means the Chair of the Committee.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-5__item-2">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>Section 4</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-5__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>Deputy Chair</i></b> means the Deputy Chair of the Committee.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-5__item-3">
